<article class="app-prose app-prose--summary">
    <h2>One calm place for studio procurement</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for highlight in app.highlights %}
        <li>{{ highlight }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>
        Secure account-based cloud synchronisation keeps authorised studio members up to date. Owners, admins, members, and viewers have permissions appropriate to their role.
    </p>
    <p>
        ProcureCore has no advertising or cross-app tracking. Essential cloud and subscription providers, and the optional Studio Pro AI assistant, are explained in the <a href="/apps/procurecore/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        Some features require an auto-renewing App Store subscription. Apple shows the current price, billing period, and any eligible introductory offer in the app before purchase. ProcureCore is coming soon.
    </p>
</article>
